==========================================
The flow is:

HTTP Request
    ↓
Route
    ↓
Controller
    ↓
Service
    ↓
Repository
    ↓
Model
    ↓
MongoDB

Kafka registration is handled separately:

Kafka
  ↓
userRegistration.consumer.js
  ↓
Auth Service
  ↓
Repository
  ↓
MongoDB

For login:

POST /auth/login
       ↓
auth.routes.js
       ↓
auth.controller.js
       ↓
auth.service.js
       ↓
auth.repository.js
       ↓
auth.model.js
       ↓
MongoDB
       ↓
bcrypt.compare()
       ↓
JWT
       ↓
Response